:: Domus Job Knock
<<generate1>><<person1>>
You make your way up the cracked steps to the shoddy Domus home. A <<person>> answers the door. "How can I help you?" <<he>> asks.
<br><br>
<<if $acceptedRequest is "Strange Creaking">>
    <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Say you're here about <<his>> post|Strange Creaking Intro]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $acceptedRequest is "Weird Creature">> 
    <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Say you're here about <<his>> post|Weird Creature Intro]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $acceptedRequest is "Something in Cupboard">> 
    <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Say you're here about <<his>> post|Something in Cupboard Intro]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $acceptedRequest is "Something Following">>
    <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Say you're here about <<his>> post|Something Following Intro]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

