:: Rattling Trashcans Intro
"Oh you're the exterminator? You don't look very well prepared but... I suppose you'll have to do." The <<person>> leads you to the side of the house where an old dented trashcan sits half full.
<br><br>
"You saw my post so you already know, but something keeps digging through my garbage every night and leaving trash all over my yard. I want whatever it is gone. Understood?" Without waiting for an answer, the <<person>> walks back inside, leaving you alone.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait around the can for anything (2:00)|Rattling Trashcans]]>><<pass 120>><</link>>

:: Rattling Trashcans
<<rng 50 100>>
You spend a few hours waiting and begin to tire. Just when you think this has been a waste of time, you hear a rustling from nearby.
<br><br>
<<if $world_corruption_soft gte $rng>>
    As you approach the rustling, you catch sight of something... unusual. A tiny humanoid figure, rotund and hairy, jumps from the grass, biting at you.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Gnome]]>><<set $struggle_start to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
    <<beastNEWinit 1 raccoon>>
    As you approach the rustling, a large <<beasttype>>, hairs on end, leaps out of the grass toward you.
    <br><br>
    <<if $settings.bestialityEnabled or $monster is 1>>
		<<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		You run. You manage to escape, though not unscathed.
		<<beastescape>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Fail]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Rattling Trashcans Gnome
<<effects>>
<<if $struggle_start is 1>>
	<<struggle_init>>
	<<set $struggle.creature to "gnome">>
	<<struggle_creatures 3 2>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<molested>>

	<<unset $struggle_start>>
<</if>>

<<struggle>>

<<if $struggle.done gte $struggle.number>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Gnome End]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Gnome]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>

:: Rattling Trashcans Gnome End
<<effects>>
The creatures flee into dark recesses.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Success]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Rattling Trashcans Rape
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Rape Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Rape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>


:: Rattling Trashcans Rape Finish
<<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>

	The <<beasttype>> gives a happy bark, and walks away.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Fail]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> whimpers, and runs away.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Rattling Trashcans Success]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

